OL,3,GNEWSAOne injured after shots fired at
OL,4,Apub window in Edinburgh
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person was injured after shots were
OL,7,Ffired towards the window of a bar in
OL,8,FEdinburgh.
OL,10,FThe incident on Gilmerton Road, which
OL,11,Fis believed to have happened at the
OL,12,FRobin's Nest pub, took place at about
OL,13,F21:15 on Friday.
OL,15,FPolice said the shooting was believed
OL,16,Fto have been targeted. The injured
OL,17,Fperson was treated at the scene.
OL,19,FOfficers carried out a search of the
OL,20,Farea, but no-one was traced and an
OL,21,Finvestigation into the circumstances
OL,22,Fare ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
